    "text": "AZFamily\nwebsite\nPeoria\nDream 18: Hole #9 at Quintero golf club in Peoria\n1 days ago\nArizona Senate President Warren Peterson is calling for a probe into State Sen. Analise Ortiz over releasing ICE agent locations. Sarah Robinson reports. United Airlines halted departures at airports across the country because of a \"technology issue,\" but Phoenix Sky Harbor Airport isn't one of them. About 16% of the airline's flights were delayed and some were canceled. Some included flights at Sky Harbor.",
